    "AIWLR (mg × h-1× cm-2)": {
     "choice": "measured",
     "probs": {
      "measured": 0.927,
      "literature": 0.073
     },
     "said": [
      "Finally, we calculated area-independent water loss rates as: $\\mathrm{AIWLR} = (\\mathrm{WM} - \\mathrm{WC}) \\times (\\mathrm{LD50})^{-1} \\times (\\mathrm{SA})^{-1}$ This desiccation resistance measure enables across-species comparison by adjusting for surface area (Schilman et al.",
      "pergandei) were excluded from FTL, LT, and AIWLR experiments because we could not collect suYcient foragers."
     ],
     "value": "measured"
    }
   }
